Package: gc2607-driver-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-amd64
Description: V4L2 sub-device driver for the GalaxyCore GC2607 sensor (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree V4L2 sub-device driver for the GalaxyCore GC2607 image sensor
 found behind the Intel IPU6 on the Huawei MateBook X Pro 2024. The module is
 built locally by DKMS for the running kernel and rebuilt automatically on
 kernel upgrades.
